---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="submit-container">
    <h1>How to Submit Your Capstone</h1>
    
    <p>To add your capstone project to the archive, please email the site maintainers with the following details and attached files.</p>
    
    <div class="contact-info">
      <h2>Contact Maintainers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Virgil Quita: <a href="mailto:virgil.quita@ciit.edu.ph">virgil.quita@ciit.edu.ph</a></li>
        <li>Sean Lacson: <a href="mailto:sean.lacson@ciit.edu.ph">sean.lacson@ciit.edu.ph</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="email-template">
      <h2>Sample Email Template</h2>
      <pre>
Subject: Capstone Submission - [Your Project Title]

Dear Site Maintainers,

I would like to submit my capstone project to the archive.

Project Details:
- Title: [Project Title]
- Author(s): [Your Name/Team Members]
- Year: [Year of Completion]
- Course: [Your Course]
- Description: [Brief description of your project]

Attached Files:
- Documentation: [PDF/DOC file]
- Images: [Image files of your project/demo]

Thank you for considering my submission.

Best regards,
[Your Name]
      </pre>
    </div>
    
    <div class="requirements">
      <h2>Submission Requirements</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Project Title</li>
        <li>Author(s) Name</li>
        <li>Year of Capstone</li>
        <li>Course</li>
        <li>Brief Description</li>
        <li>Documentation (PDF/DOC)</li>
        <li>Images/Demo Videos (Optional but recommended)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .submit-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    color: #2c3e50;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact-info, .email-template, .requirements {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .email-template pre {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: monospace;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  ul {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
